# CE Points — product

## Why this exists

Build the **default** combined-events points app for athletes and fans — not “another calculator.” Competitors (sites, one older App Store app, new AI clones) make craft the moat. Prefer fewer features done excellently over more features done okay.

## Non-negotiables

- **Trust scoring first.** Points, inverse points, rankings, and World Athletics alignment must feel correct and fast. UI polish never ships over a scoring bug.
- **Calculators stay clear.** Performance ↔ points, world-record placeholders (faded), light/dark parity on nested surfaces (chart insets, cards).
- **Rankings are a pillar**, not an afterthought — same care as calculators.
- **Expo is fine.** Prefer Reanimated / Gesture Handler / existing native tabs & glass over a Swift rewrite unless a platform feature truly requires it.
- **Ship the detail users feel**, not dashboard chrome. No clutter for its own sake.

## When changing the app

Ask: does this make CE Points more inevitable as the default tool? If not, skip or simplify.
